{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter and Escape the Compound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After sneaking in to investigate, find your way out of the gardens, eerie corridors, labyrinths and art galleries. For each newly visited area, your character will take a photo. Consult the photo album to help track your journey and ensure nothing is missed.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Enter_and_Escape_the_Compound.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the Enigma</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To uncover what went wrong in this former amusement park, engage with objects to awaken your sixth sense, revealing clues and memories left behind by visitors and, perhaps, yourself.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Uncover_The_Enigma.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some puzzles are random and not the same each time you play. Physics and perspective puzzles create the path needed to move forward.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Solve_Puzzles.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is designed to feel real and make you believe like you are there: the sound of the wind, your footsteps on various surfaces. Water ripples and slows you down as you walk through it. Foliage bends and rustles as you brush past it. The minimalist HUD and seamless level loading keep you immersed.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Immersive_Environment.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Change the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up umbrellas or sunglasses to change the weather. Make it rain or shine to match the mood you want.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Change_the_Weather.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as a Walking Sim or Against Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a quiet, haunting walk, or enable each entity type and jump scares individually to intensify the experience. Fend off venomous insects with bug spray. If you encounter the Groundskeeper... run for your life!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Play_Against_Entities.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3207210?t=1744629045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3207210?t=1744629045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/8063265832c171171a0173a7cfba09b557ed630e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744629045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/8063265832c171171a0173a7cfba09b557ed630e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744629045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3415070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter and Escape the Compound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After sneaking in to investigate, find your way out of the gardens, eerie corridors, labyrinths and art galleries. For each newly visited area, your character will take a photo. Consult the photo album to help track your journey and ensure nothing is missed.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Enter_and_Escape_the_Compound.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the Enigma</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To uncover what went wrong in this former amusement park, engage with objects to awaken your sixth sense, revealing clues and memories left behind by visitors and, perhaps, yourself.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Uncover_The_Enigma.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some puzzles are random and not the same each time you play. Physics and perspective puzzles create the path needed to move forward.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Solve_Puzzles.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is designed to feel real and make you believe like you are there: the sound of the wind, your footsteps on various surfaces. Water ripples and slows you down as you walk through it. Foliage bends and rustles as you brush past it. The minimalist HUD and seamless level loading keep you immersed.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Immersive_Environment.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Change the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up umbrellas or sunglasses to change the weather. Make it rain or shine to match the mood you want.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Change_the_Weather.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as a Walking Sim or Against Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a quiet, haunting walk, or enable each entity type and jump scares individually to intensify the experience. Fend off venomous insects with bug spray. If you encounter the Groundskeeper... run for your life!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/Play_Against_Entities.gif?t=1744629045\" /></p>","developers":["7D Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/73ef7161d60af9195f4ecb29ee4f0ed21698efd6/header.jpg?t=1744629045","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257054774,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054774/movie480.mp4?t=1730197776","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054774/movie_max.mp4?t=1730197776"},"name":"Greenhouse Environment Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257054774/03a44e37c926eaf9564c35f3270fcc910586343f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730197776","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054774/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1730197776","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054774/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1730197776"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257069374,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069374/movie480.mp4?t=1730197781","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069374/movie_max.mp4?t=1730197781"},"name":"Greenhouse Survival Mode Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257069374/69bb515ab0e27c432c526ccaab336a3d19493ec0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730197781","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steam